<Layout title="Website terms and booking scope" description="Understand the scope of this Legacy Music Group website. Session reservations, payments and current recording terms are handled through the existing Legacy booking system."><div class="shell"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Legacy Music Group</p><h1>Know what<br /><em>you’re booking.</em></h1></header><article class="reading"><h2>Studio information</h2><p>This website describes Legacy Music Group’s studio and services. Published starting rates are a guide; current availability, service scope and the final total must be confirmed with the studio.</p><h2>Reservations and payments</h2><p>Opening a booking link or preparing an email does not reserve a session. Complete the process on Legacy’s booking website and look for a confirmation from that system.</p><h2>Your project</h2><p>Confirm the intended deliverables, file requirements, turnaround, revisions and any production rights directly with Legacy. This website does not add promises or guarantees to your agreement.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact the studio before booking if a term, price or service is unclear. The current recording terms are linked from the booking page.</p></article></div></Layout>
